    "krkrthreepp:Threepp.PerspectiveCamera.applyScreenAffine": {
      "hash": "4b3c43dc2aab",
      "ja": {
        "summary": "投影行列に画面上の 2D アフィンを後掛けする (updateProjectionMatrix の後に呼ぶ。Camera 共通)。",
        "description": "NDC で x' = a*x + b*y + tx, y' = c*x + d*y + ty。カメラの全画角を画面の任意の平行四辺形へ\n写せるので、2D 側の拡大・回転・位置を「描いた後の拡大」ではなく描画そのものに反映できる。"
      },
      "tr": {
        "summary": "Post-multiplies the projection matrix by a 2D on-screen affine transform (call after updateProjectionMatrix; common to all cameras).",
        "description": "In NDC: x' = a*x + b*y + tx, y' = c*x + d*y + ty. Because the camera's entire view can be mapped to any parallelogram on the screen, 2D-side scaling, rotation and positioning are applied to the rendering itself rather than as scaling after drawing."
      }
    }
